    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90171.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 5,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, we're supposed to get up into the upper sicketies today. Oh, that's great. Yeah, but that's perfect. Great and gloom are accompanying it. So not quite spring. I guess that's part of the story. We would invite you on today to talk about a new bill that you've been working on is called expanding access to low cost generics act. Tell us about this.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
