        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience values discussion of legislative initiatives related to healthcare affordability.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "The phrase 'that's part of the story' implies shared understanding of larger systemic patterns in weather or policy.",
