    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90171.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "All right, I'm going to put you on the spot here a little bit. I don't know if you would know the answer to this, but some common everyday medications, drugs that people would take. Are they ones that people will recognize and are they ones that people have complained to you about?",
